  "content": "<p>直达：<a href=\"https://offmedian.com/zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://offmedian.com/zh</a><br/>\n打牌（单机）：<a href=\"https://offmedian.com/zh#lounge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://offmedian.com/zh#lounge</a><br/>\n打牌（单机-ascii）：<a href=\"https://offmedian.com/zh#lounge:ascii\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://offmedian.com/zh#lounge:ascii</a><br/>\n打牌（联机）：<a href=\"https://offmedian.com/zh#lounge:online\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://offmedian.com/zh#lounge:online</a></p>\n<p>普通模式<br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/oqS139Y.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oqS139Y.png\"/></a></p>\n<p>隐蔽模式<br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wBm8iWx.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wBm8iWx.png\"/></a></p>\n<p>沉浸模式<br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/zE15cMm.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zE15cMm.png\"/></a></p>\n<p>拉上 Agent 一起打牌<br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/IkmlYa4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IkmlYa4.png\"/></a></p>\n<p>项目本体是一个推特情报站 <a href=\"https://offmedian.com/zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://offmedian.com/zh</a></p>\n<p>现在收录了 20,000 位创作者，然后也支持 API/MCP，有下面这些功能，然后数据其实目前还不全，还在补。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>黑马推文榜：按每位作者近 30 天日常浏览中位数算「黑马倍率」，把中小号突然跑出来的高倍率爆款和高收藏长推捞出来，英文原帖支持对照看<br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOIroFq.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOIroFq.png\"/></a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>趋势与英文圈先热：看各领域热度涨跌，以及英文圈刚起势、中文圈还没刷屏的话题。<br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/OsUILJp.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OsUILJp.png\"/></a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>创作者档案：直接看日常浏览中位数、收藏率、曝光效率和关联产品，一眼辨别真实含金量。<br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/4xcH3xP.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4xcH3xP.png\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/nZQMeL1.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nZQMeL1.png\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/rqgR3ym.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rqgR3ym.png\"/></a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>直达：<a href=\"https://offmedian.com/zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://offmedian.com/zh</a></p>",
